<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<style>
    body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
</style>

<body class="bg-gray-50">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
                <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-10">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                            <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-900">About Us</h2>
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                            Solanki Pipes was established in 2005. For over 15 years, Solanki Pipes has been a trusted name in the pipe industry with its distribution network all over India. We are a dynamic, quality-driven company with a firm eye on the future. The strength of our company lies in our quality products and satisfied customers. We are a leading manufacturer of HDPE Pipes, HDPE Gas Pipes, PVC Pipes, Sprinkler Pipes, PPR Pipes, HDPE Fittings, and Synthetic Rubber Adhesive. Our factories are situated at Hisar, Mandi Adampur in Fatehabad District, Haryana.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                            <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-900">Solanki Pipes to Excellence</h2>
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                            We obtained certification from ISO-9001:2015 and follow all procedures and processes needed to fulfill the quality management system. We are committed to total customer satisfaction which shall be achieved by providing cost-effective quality products with timely delivery.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-1/3">
                    <img src="/image/solanki_pipes_main_gate.jpeg" alt="Industrial Pipe Stacks" class="w-full drop-shadow-2xl">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="mb-12 border-b-8 border-red-600 overflow-hidden rounded-t-lg">
                    <img src="/public/image/IMG_0524.jpg.jpeg" class="w-full h-64 md:h-full object-cover" alt="Industrial Pipeline">
                </div>

                <div class="relative pt-16">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20">
                        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-center">SOLANKI<br>PIPES</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-64 mb-12">
                        <div class="p-6 border-2 border-red-600 bg-white shadow-sm">
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">To provide unmatched solutions that help our clients become more productive and profitable.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-6 border-2 border-red-600 bg-white shadow-sm text-right">
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">To become the pioneers in the field of modern Plumbing and Piping technologies and offer customers more value through our products.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center px-10 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-red-600">MISSION</h3>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-red-600">VALUES</h3>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-red-600">VISION</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative h-2 bg-orange-500 w-full rounded-full">
                        <div class="absolute -top-1 left-1/4 w-4 h-4 bg-red-600 rounded-full"></div>
                        <div class="absolute -top-1 left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-red-600 rounded-full"></div>
                        <div class="absolute -top-1 left-3/4 w-4 h-4 bg-red-600 rounded-full"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-12">
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-4">
                            <h4 class="font-black text-red-600 uppercase italic">Expertise</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs mt-2 font-bold text-gray-600 italic">We are a dedicated team of dynamic professionals having immense market knowledge.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-4">
                            <h4 class="font-black text-red-600 uppercase italic">Agile</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs mt-2 font-bold text-gray-600 italic">Being quick and responsive is ingrained in our culture. We understand your needs and get cracking.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-4">
                            <h4 class="font-black text-red-600 uppercase italic">Transparent</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs mt-2 font-bold text-gray-600 italic">We focus and deliver realistic solutions. We are straight-up and honest. We are committed to deliver the best in the industry.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-4">
                            <h4 class="font-black text-red-600 uppercase italic">Partnership</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs mt-2 font-bold text-gray-600 italic">Our business is about understanding the needs of our clients. We provide proactive, strategic thinking to clients.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-gray-50">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-stretch">
                <div class="md:w-1/3 border-4 border-orange-500 p-8 flex flex-col justify-center bg-white">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                        <span class="w-6 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                        <h2 class="heading-font text-2xl font-black uppercase text-gray-900">Our Infrastructure</h2>
                        <span class="w-6 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-800 font-bold text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        We are geared up with a huge infrastructural set-up in order to meet the growing demand of our clients. We are equipped with latest machinery and are able to call on technology and experienced personnel covering a wide range of skills related to plastic pipes and their applications.
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="md:w-2/3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded shadow-lg">
                        <img src="/public/image/solanki_offshore_piping_system.jpeg" class="w-full h-full object-contain hover:scale-105 transition duration-500" alt="Factory Floor">
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded shadow-lg bg-blue-500   ">
                        <img src="/public/image/solanki_hdpe_pipes.png" class="w-full h-full object-contain hover:scale-105 transition duration-500" alt="Pipe Extrusion">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>